mspatcha: 32-bit PE patching (Wine MR 3870) + old files larger than the LZXD window

Ported to Wine 11.19 from https://gitlab.winehq.org/wine/wine/-/merge_requests/3870
(Aidan Khoury, 2023, LGPL - "mspatcha: Add support for 32-bit file image
patch", normalization, GetFilePatchSignature*), with heap_* replaced by the
CRT allocation functions Wine uses now. On top of it: delta patches whose old
file is larger than the LZXD window decode with the first window-size bytes of
the old file as reference (black-box tested against Windows' output).

